{"unit_id":"xtd1145__dsh-full-access-switch#card-zh","repo":"xtd1145/dsh-full-access-switch","commit":"6175d10325aa4b4dd081f9168101090f2777ae7d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Full Access 一次性开关（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 新会话设置默认 Full access。bundle 覆盖权限配置；PowerShell 安装脚本还可给权限界面和会话选择器增加记住偏好的开关。它支持默认权限设定、浏览器本地保存确认选择、为客户端文件应用补丁，并可卸载恢复备份及移除默认权限设置。适合希望减少新会话权限确认操作的用户。bundle 无需密钥；完整界面补丁需在 Windows 上运行 PowerShell。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-21","install.ps1:34-53","uninstall.ps1:29-52","patches/dsh-client-ui-permission-presets.client.js.diff:61-82","patches/dsh-client-ui-conversation.client.js.diff:25-33"]}
