{"unit_id":"xtd1145__dsh-full-access-switch#feature-1","repo":"xtd1145/dsh-full-access-switch","commit":"6175d10325aa4b4dd081f9168101090f2777ae7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Full Access 一次性开关 的功能「新会话默认权限」：把默认预设设为 danger-full-access，并将对应审批设为 never。安装 bundle 后，新建工作区或对话会采用该默认权限配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-21"]}
